  "properties": {
    "title": "Samoa administrative and jurisdictional boundaries (long table)",
    "description": "All boundary levels for Samoa, from the EEZ to the finest published level, stacked in one table (one row per unit per level). Sources: Pacific Community (SPC), Geoscience, Energy and Maritime Division, \"Global Exclusive Economic Zones (200 Nautical Miles) - Merged Dataset (SPC Pacific Maritime Boundaries)\" (spc-gem-pacific-eez-200nm); geoBoundaries (William & Mary geoLab), \"geoBoundaries gbOpen WSM ADM0-ADM2\" (wsm-geoboundaries-gbopen); SPC Statistics for Development Division (SDD) for Samoa Bureau of Statistics, \"2011 Samoa PHC administrative boundaries (regions, districts, enumeration areas)\" (wsm-sbs-phc2011-admin-boundaries). Licences (per row in the `license` column): CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0, CC-BY-4.0, CC-BY-SA-3.0. Some rows are used and redistributed by this project under a data-use agreement (CSDR-SPC data use agreement (user-confirmed 2026-11-20)); downstream users are bound by the row's public licence (e.g. CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) unless they hold their own agreement. Full provenance and source notes: https://github.com/SustainableDevelopmentReform/pacific-administrative-boundaries/blob/v0.1.0/docs/sources.md#wsm-samoa.",
